[gd_resource type="Environment" load_steps=3 format=3]

; Default 3D environment for every match scene.
;
; Art direction: "graphite and machined aluminium, lit by sodium orange and
; instrument teal" — semi-realistic, deliberately *medium* fidelity: real
; directional shadows, depth fog and a gentle ACES curve do most of the work,
; while the expensive effects (SSAO, SSIL, SDFGI, screen-space reflections,
; volumetric fog) stay off because the Mobile renderer cannot afford them on a
; mid-range phone and they cost more quality than they add at our density.
;
; Colours are the Design palette in linear-ish sRGB, so a HUD element and a
; wall lit by the same accent read as the same colour.

